---
import { Timeline } from 'astro-pure/user'
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import ToolSection from '@/components/about/ToolSection.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'about-me', text: 'Overview' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'tools', text: 'Tools' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'social-networks', text: 'Contact' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'about-blog', text: 'About This Site' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings} comment>
  <p>合肥工业大学在读，关注 AI Agent 与全栈开发。</p>
  <p>平时喜欢把想法做成能跑起来的东西，再把过程记录下来。这个站点就是其中之一。</p>
  <p>Motto: Stay hungry, stay foolish.</p>

  <h2 id='about-me'>Overview</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>在读：合肥工业大学</li>
    <li>关注方向：AI Agent、全栈开发</li>
    <li>所在地：安徽 宣城</li>
    <li>常用语言：TypeScript / Java / Python / Verilog</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id='tools'>Tools</h2>
  <ToolSection
    title='Daily Essentials'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'VS Code',
        description: 'Code editor',
        href: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/vscode.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Chrome',
        description: 'Web browser',
        href: 'https://www.google.com/chrome/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/chrome.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Windows 11',
        description: 'Operating system',
        href: 'https://www.microsoft.com/windows/windows-11',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/windows11.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />

  <ToolSection
    class='mt-4'
    title='AI & Code Assistants'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'ChatGPT',
        description: 'AI assistant',
        href: 'https://chatgpt.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/chatgpt.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Claude Code',
        description: 'Coding agent',
        href: 'https://claude.com/product/claude-code',
        icon: 'CC'
      },
      {
        name: 'Codex',
        description: 'Coding agent',
        href: 'https://openai.com/codex/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/chatgpt.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Hermes Agent',
        description: 'Personal AI agent',
        href: 'https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/',
        icon: 'H'
      }
    ]}
  />

  <ToolSection
    class='mt-4'
    title='Runtime & Package Managers'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Node.js',
        description: 'JavaScript runtime',
        href: 'https://nodejs.org/',
        icon: 'JS'
      },
      {
        name: 'npm',
        description: 'JavaScript package manager',
        href: 'https://www.npmjs.com/',
        icon: 'npm'
      },
      {
        name: 'JDK',
        description: 'Java development kit',
        href: 'https://openjdk.org/',
        icon: 'J'
      },
      {
        name: 'Maven',
        description: 'Java build tool',
        href: 'https://maven.apache.org/',
        icon: 'MVN'
      }
    ]}
  />

  <h2 id='social-networks'>Contact</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      GitHub: <a href='https://github.com/clerimia' target='_blank'>@clerimia</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      Email: <a href='mailto:1937049668@qq.com'>1937049668@qq.com</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id='about-blog'>About This Site</h2>
  <p>站点历史：</p>
  <Timeline
    events={[
      {
        date: '2024',
        content: '用 Hexo 搭起第一个博客'
      },
      {
        date: '2026-09',
        content: '迁移到 Astro，手写了一套自己的脚手架'
      },
      {
        date: '2026-09-17',
        content:
          '改用 <a href="https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure" target="_blank">Astro Theme Pure</a> 主题，专注写内容'
      }
    ]}
  />
  <p>本站由以下项目与服务驱动：</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      框架：<a href='https://astro.build/' target='_blank'>Astro</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      主题：<a href='https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure' target='_blank'>Astro Theme Pure</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      样式：<a href='https://unocss.dev/' target='_blank'>UnoCSS</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      托管：<a href='https://pages.github.com/' target='_blank'>GitHub Pages</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      搜索：<a href='https://pagefind.app/' target='_blank'>Pagefind</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
